BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 778.00 Td (- Attention quality drops as context increases: LLMs lose accuracy and focus when you overload them. RAG) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 764.60 Td (narrows the context -> better reasoning. So RAG is valuable and will be in the future too) Tj ET
