q 479.00 0 0 364.85 58.00 326.30 cm /Im5 Do Q
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 317.30 Td (In this article we will talk about Document Preprocessing that is basically Data Ingestion, and Data Chunking and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 303.90 Td (different strategies in chunking. In the next article we will talk about Embedding generation and retrieval.) Tj ET
