BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 255.35 Td (Everyone thinks Data Ingestion is easy \223just upload a PDF and extract text\224 but there are so many complexities) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 241.95 Td (involved in this as well, If given a PDF, where would you store it, how would you parse it? How would you deal) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 228.55 Td (with images and tables?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 208.65 Td (There are some powerful libraries that you should know:) Tj ET
