BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 778.00 Td (If yes, how much compute and memory can you realistically dedicate to it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 758.10 Td (If you want the best possible performance with minimal infra hassle, you\222ll likely start with a hosted API such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 744.70 Td (GPT or Claude. The trade-offs:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 724.80 Td (Pros: strong model quality, easy to integrate, no infra to maintain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 704.90 Td (Cons: You\222re sending data to a third-party API \(the data is leaving your system\), and you pay per token.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 685.00 Td (If you want to run models locally \(or in your own VPC\), the second question becomes more important:) Tj ET
