BT /F2 10.5 Tf 58.00 561.10 Td (Why Prompting Matters in RAG) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 543.45 Td (Writing effective prompts becomes a very important aspect in RAG as well because without effective prompting,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 530.05 Td (even the most relevant retrieved information might not be used correctly by the LLM.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 510.15 Td (The key reasons prompting matters in RAG are:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 490.25 Td (Avoiding Hallucinations: This is perhaps the most critical role. A well-crafted prompt explicitly instructs the LLM) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 476.85 Td (to only use the information provided in the context, preventing it from fabricating details or drawing upon its) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 463.45 Td (general knowledge when the context is insufficient.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 443.55 Td (Generating Custom Outputs: Prompting allows you to define the desired behavior, personality, tone, and style of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 430.15 Td (the LLM\222s response. Want a friendly, concise answer or a detailed, formal one? Prompting makes it possible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 410.25 Td (Setting Up Constraints and Rules: You can use prompts to enforce specific rules, such as prohibiting the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 396.85 Td (mention of certain topics or requiring a particular format \(like bullet points or JSON\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 376.95 Td (Almost every generation prompt in a production RAG system is some combination of these 4 layers:) Tj ET
