BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 778.00 Td (Compare answer against:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 758.10 Td (The context \(for groundedness\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 738.20 Td (The expected answer \(if you have one\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 718.30 Td (Key dimensions:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 698.40 Td (Faithfulness / Groundedness - Does the answer stick to the provided context, or is it making stuff up?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 678.50 Td (Relevance - Does it actually answer the question?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 658.60 Td (Correctness - If you have a expected answers, how close is it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 638.70 Td (Completeness - Does it cover all important parts of the query \(not just one slice\)?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 618.80 Td (Again, you can:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 598.90 Td (Do this manually at first,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 579.00 Td (Then automate with an evaluator model \(\223LLM-as-judge\224\), which you prompt like: \223Given the question, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 565.60 Td (context, and the answer, rate:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 545.70 Td (Faithfulness: 1\2265) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 525.80 Td (Relevance: 1\2265) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 505.90 Td (Completeness: 1\2265 And explain briefly why.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 486.00 Td (You can store these scores and take averages across the datasets or there are frameworks just for evaluation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 472.60 Td (buil for example like RAGAS.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 452.70 Td (Step 4: Measure Formatting & Contract Compliance) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 432.80 Td (For production apps, it\222s not enough that the text is correct; it must also:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 412.90 Td (Return valid JSON when you ask for JSON.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 393.00 Td (Respect length constraints \(\223< 200 words\224\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 373.10 Td (Use the right tone or structure \(e.g., always bullet points\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 353.20 Td (So you add checks like:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 333.30 Td (\223Is the output valid JSON?\224 -> yes/no) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 313.40 Td (\223Does it contain all required fields?\224 -> yes/no) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 293.50 Td (\223Does it exceed X tokens?\224 -> yes/no) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 273.60 Td (These can be fully automated with simple scripts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 253.70 Td (Step 4: Close the loop and compare different configurations) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 233.80 Td (Now the fun part: you can experiment and compare setups:) Tj ET
