BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 694.75 Td (Proper Distillation also called as the Standard Distillation is a type of Knowledge Distillation process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 674.85 Td (Here, the student model starts as a completely untrained, randomly initialized network, same as any model) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 661.45 Td (before training begins.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 641.55 Td (Here's the sequence at step 1:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 72.00 621.65 Td (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 621.65 Td (Student has random weights. Feed it a piece of text.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 72.00 605.75 Td (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 605.75 Td (Its prediction is garbage, essentially random probabilities over the vocabulary, since it hasn't learned) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 592.35 Td (anything yet.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 72.00 576.45 Td (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 576.45 Td (The teacher \(already fully trained, frozen\) is fed the same text and produces its own soft distribution, this) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 563.05 Td (one is meaningful, not random.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 72.00 547.15 Td (4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 547.15 Td (You compare the student's garbage output to the teacher's meaningful output, compute the loss, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 533.75 Td (backpropagate it through the student's neural network. The teacher's weights don't change; it's just being) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 520.35 Td (used to generate a target.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 72.00 504.45 Td (5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 82.68 504.45 Td (The student's weights shift a tiny bit toward matching the teacher.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 488.55 Td (Repeat this billions of times across the training corpus. Each step nudges the student a little closer to producing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 475.15 Td (distributions like the teacher's. By the end, the student despite having far fewer parameters has gradually) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 461.75 Td (learned to approximate the teacher's behavior.) Tj ET
